pṛ0 1) prāsādamaṇḍanaṃ 
śrīsūtradhāramaṇḍanaviracitam | 

śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ | śrīkarañjeśvarghyai namaḥ || 

gaṇeśāya namastasmai nirvighnaṃ siddhihetave | 
ādigaurīsamudbhūtatejasoṃśabhavāya vai || 1 || 

mahāmāyeti yā gītā cinmayī munisattamaiḥ | 
tanotu vāgvilāsaṃ me jihvāyāṃ sā sarasvatī || 2 || 

sṛṣṭaṃ śrīsūtradhārasya prasādād viśvakarmaṇā | 
prāsādamaṇḍanaṃ brūte sūtradhāreṣu maṇḍanaḥ || 3 || 

gṛheṣu yo vidhiḥ prokto viniveśapraveśane |
sa eva vidhinā kāryo devatāyataneṣvapi || 4 || 

himādreruttare pārśve devadāruvanaṃ param |
pāvanaṃ śaṅkarasthānaṃ tatra sarvaiḥ śivo'rcitaḥ || 5 || 
------------
1 veśma iti pāṭhāntaram | 

pṛ0 2) prāsādākārapūjābhirdevadaityādibhiḥ kramāt | 
caturdaśa samutpannāḥ prāsādānāṃ ca jātayaḥ || 6 || 

nāgarā drāviḍāścaiva bhūmijā lavināstathā | 
sārvadhārā vimānādināgarāḥ puṣpakāṅkitāḥ || 7 || 

prāsādamiśrakāścaivamaṣṭau jātiṣu cottamāḥ | 
sarvadeveṣu kartavyāḥ śivasyāpi viśeṣataḥ || 8 || 

prāsādānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ jātayo deśabhedataḥ | 
caturdaśa pravartante jñeyā lokānusārataḥ || 9 || 

lakṣyalakṣaṇato'bhyāsād gurumārgānusārataḥ | 
prāsādabhavanādīnāṃ sarvajñānamavāpyate || 10 || 

śubhalagne śubharkṣeṃ ca pañcagrahabalānvite | 
māsasaṅkrāntivatsādiniṣedhe kālavarjite || 11 || 

sarvadikṣu plavāṃ vā prāgudakśaṅkaradikplavām | 
bhuvaṃ parīkṣya siñcet tu pañcagavyena kovidaḥ || 12 || 

maṇinā svarṇarūpyeṇa vidrumeṇa phalena vā | 
catuḥṣaṣṭipadairvāstuṃ likhedvāpi śatāṃśakaiḥ || 13 || 

piṣṭena vākṣatairūrdhvaṃ tato vāstuṃ samarcayet | 
pūrvoktena vidhānena balipuṣpādipūjanaiḥ || 14 || 

indro vahniḥ pitṛpatirnairṛtirvaruṇo marut | 
kuberaḥ īśaḥ patayaḥ pūrvādīnāṃ diśāṃ kramāt || 15 || 

dikpālāḥ kṣetrapālāśca gaṇeśaścaṇḍikā tathā | 
ityeṣāṃ vidhivatpūjāṃ kṛtvā karma samārabhet || 16 || 

dhanurmīnasthite sūrye gurau śukre'stage vidhau | 
vaidhṛtau vyatipāte bhedagdhe neṣṭaṃ kadācana || 17 || 

pṛ0 3) kanyāditritrige sūrye dvāraṃ pūrvādiṣu tyajet | 
sṛṣṭyā vatsamukhaṃ tatra svāmino hānikṛdyataḥ || 18 || 

āyo vyayarkṣamaṃśasya bhittibāhye surālaye | 
dhvajāyo devanakṣatraṃ vyayāṃśau prathamau śubhau || 19 || 

keṣāṃ ca marutāṃ gehe vṛṣa siṃha gajāḥ śubhāḥ | 
hīna āyād vyayaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ piśācastu samo'dhikaḥ || 20 || 

devatānāṃ gṛhe cintyamāyādyaṅgacatuṣṭayam | 
navāṅgaṃ nāḍivedyādisthāpakābha . . . . yormithaḥ || 21 || 

āyādicintanaṃ bhūmilakṣaṇaṃ vāstumaṇḍalam | 
māsanakṣatralagnādicintanaṃ pūrvaśāstrataḥ || 22 || 

rātrau diksādhanaṃ kuryād dīpasūtradhruvaikyataḥ | 
same bhūmipradeśe tu śaṅkunā divase'thavā || 23 || 

nāgavāstuṃ samālokya kuryāt khātavidhiṃ sudhīḥ | 
pāṣāṇāntaṃ jalāntaṃ vā tataḥ kūrmaṃ niveśayet || 24 || 

ardhāṅgulo bhavetkūrma ekahaste surālaye | 
ardhāṅgulā tato vṛddhiḥ kāryā tithikarāvadhiḥ || 25 || 

ekatriśatkarāntaṃ ca tadardhā vṛddhiriṣyate | 
tato'rddhādi śatārddhāntaṃ kūrmo manvaṅgulo mataḥ || 26 || 

caturthāṃśādhiko jyeṣṭhaḥ kaniṣṭho hīnayogataḥ | 
sauvarṇo rūpyajo vāpi snāpyaḥ pañcāsṛtena hi || 27 || 

tilairyavaistathā homaṃ pūrṇāṃ caiva pradāpayet | 
īśānādagnikoṇādvā śilāḥ sthāpyāḥ pradakṣiṇāḥ || 28 || 

madhye kūrmaśilā paścādgītavāditramaṅgalaiḥ | 
balidānaṃ ca naivedyaṃ vividhānnaṃ ghṛtaplutam || 29 || 

pṛ0 4) devatābhyaḥ sudhīrdadyāt kūrmanyāse śilāsu ca | 
iti kūmasthāpanam | 

sūtrārambho gṛhādīnāmuttarāyāṃ karatraye | 
brāhme puṣye mṛge maitre pauṣṇavāsavavāruṇe || 30 || 

śilānyāsastu rohiṇyāṃ śravaṇe hastapuṣyayoḥ | 
mṛgaśīrṣe ca revatyāmuttarātritaye śubhaḥ || 31 || 

nadyāṃ siddhāśrame tīrthe pure grāme ca gahvare | 
vāṭīvāpitaḍāgādisthāne kāryaṃ murālayam || 32 || 

śaktyā kāṣṭhamṛtsneṣṭakāśailadhātujaratnajam | 
devatāyatanaṃ kuryāddharmārthakāmamokṣadam || 33 || 

devānāṃ sthāpanaṃ pūjā pāpahṛddarśanādikam | 
dharmavṛddhirbhavedathaḥ kāmo mokṣastato nṛṇām || 34 || 

koṭighnaṃ tṛṇaje puṇyaṃ mṛnmaye daśasaṃguṇam | 
aiṣṭake śatakoṭighnaṃ śaile'nantaṃ phalaṃ gṛhe || 35 || 

kūrmasaṃsthāpane dvāre padmākhyāyāṃ tu pauruṣe | 
ghaṭe dhvaje pratiṣṭhāyāmevaṃ puṇyāhasaptakam || 36 || 

bhūmyārambhe tathā kūrme śilāyāṃ sūtrapātane | 
khure dvārocchraye kumbhe paṭṭe padmaśilāsu ca || 37 || 

śukranāse ca puruṣe ghaṇṭāyāṃ kalaśe tathā | 
dhvajocchrāya ca kurvīta śāntikāni caturdaśaṃ || 38 || 

ekahastādiprāsādo yāvaddhastaśatārdhakam | 
pramāṇaṃ kumbhake mūlanāsike bhittibāhyataḥ || 39 || 

kumbhādisthāvarāṇāṃ ca nirgamaḥ samasūtrataḥ | 
pīṭhasya nirgamo bāhyastathaiva cchādyakasya ca || 40 || 

pṛ0 5) tripañcasaptanavabhiḥ phālanābhirvibhājayet | 
prāsādamaṅgasraṃkhyā ca vārimārgāntarasthitāḥ || 41 || 

phālanā karṇatulyā syādbhadraṃ tu dviguṇaṃ samam | 
sāmānyo'yaṃ vidhistulyo hastāṅgulaśca nirgamaḥ || 42 || 

iti śrīsūtradhāramaṇḍanaviracite prāsādamaṇḍane vāstuśāstre miśrakalakṣaṇe prathamo'dhyāyaḥ || 1 || 

atha dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ | 

prāsādānāmadhiṣṭhānaṃ jagatī sā nigadyate | 
yathā siṃhāsanaṃ rājñāṃ prāsādasya tathaiva sā || 1 || 

caturasrāyatāṣṭāsrā vṛttā vṛttāyatā tathā | 
jagatī pañcadhā proktā prāsādasyānurūpyataḥ || 2 || 

prāsādapṛthumānā ca triguṇā ca caturguṇā | 
kramāt pañcaguṇā proktā jyeṣṭhā madhyā kanīyasī || 3 || 

kanyase kanyasā jyeṣṭhā jyeṣṭhe madhye ca madhyamā | 
prāsāde jagatī kāryā surūpā lakṣaṇānvitā || 4 || 

rasasaptaguṇākhyātā nije paryāyasaṃsthitā | 
dvārakāyāṃ tu kartavyā tathaiva puruṣatraye || 5 || 

maṇḍapānukrameṇaiva sapādāṃśena sārddhataḥ | 
dviguṇā vāyatā kāryā sahasrāyatane vidhiḥ || 6 || 

tridvyekabhramasaṃyuktā jyeṣṭhā madhyā kanīyasī | 
ucchrayaḥ svatribhāgena bhramaṇīnāṃ samucchrayaḥ || 7 || 

catuṣkoṇaistathā sūryakoṇairviṃśatikoṇakaiḥ | 
aṣṭāviṃśatiṣaṭtriṃśatkoṇaiḥ syuḥ pañca phālanāḥ || 8 || 

pṛ0 6) prāsādādarkahastāntaṃ triṃśoccā viṃśatī ca sā | 
dvātriṃśatī caturthāṃśo bhūtāṃśoccā śatārddhaka || 9 || 

ekahaste kareṇoccā sādhyārdhaṃ sā catuṣkare | 
sūryajainaśatārddhāntaṃ kramāddvitriyugāṃśakaiḥ || 10 || 

taducchrāyaṃ bhajet prājñastvaṣṭāviṃśatibhiḥ padaiḥ | 
tripado jāḍyakumbhaśca dvipadaṃ kaṇakaṃ tathā || 11 || 

padmapatrasamāyuktā tripadā sarapaṭṭikā | 
dvipadaṃ khurakaṃ kuryāt saptabhāgaṃ ca kumbhakam || 12 || 

kalaśastripadaḥ prokto bhāgenāntarapatrakam | 
kapotālistribhāge ca puṣpakaṇṭho yugāṃśakaiḥ || 13 || 

puṣpako jāḍyakumbhaśca nirgamaścāṣṭabhiḥ padaiḥ | 
karṇeṣu ca diśāṃpālāḥ prācyādiṣu pradakṣiṇāḥ || 14 || 

prākārairmaṇḍitā kāryā caturbhirdvāramaṇḍapaiḥ | 
prākārairjalaniṣkāsaiḥ sopānaistoraṇādibhiḥ || 15 || 

maṇḍapāgre pratolyagre sopānaṃ śuṇḍikāgrataḥ | 
toraṇaṃ kārayet tasya paṭṭaṃ paṭṭānusārataḥ || 16 || 

toraṇasyomayoḥ staṃbhavistaraṃ garbhamānataḥ | 
bhittigarbhapramāṇena tayormadhye'thavā bhavet || 17 || 

vedikāpīṭharūpaiśca śobhābhirbahubhiryutā | 
vicitraṃ toraṇaṃ kuryād dolā devasya tatra ca || 18 || 

prāsādādvāhanasthāne karaṇīyā catuṣkikā | 
ekadvitricatuṣpañcarasasaptapadāntare || 19 || 

arcāyā navamāṃśe tu pañcaṣaṭsaptabhāgikaḥ | 
guhyanābhistanāntaṃ vā trividho vāhanodayaḥ || 20 || 

pṛ0 7) pādajānukaṭīyāvadarcāyāṃ vāhanasya dṛk | 
vṛṣasya viṣṇubhāgānte sūrye vyomastanāntakam || 21 || 

jināgre samavarṇāgraṃ śukāgre gūḍhamaṇḍape | 
gūḍhasyāgre catuṣkā syāttadagre nṛtyamaṇḍapam || 22 || 

dvisaptatyā dvibāṇairvā caturviṃśatito'pivā | 
jinālaye caturdikṣu sahitaṃ jinamandiram || 23 || 

maṇḍapād garbhasūtreṇa vāmadakṣiṇayordiśoḥ | 
aṣṭāpadaṃ prakartavyaṃ triśālā vā varāṇakam || 24 || 

apare rathaśālā ca maṭhaṃ yāmye prakīrtitam | 
uttare ratharandhraṃ ca proktaṃ śrīviśvakarmaṇā || 25 || 

jagatīṃ tādṛśīṃ kuryātprāsādo yādṛśo bhavet | 
bhinnacchandā na kartavyā prāsādāsanasaṃsthistā || 26 || 

iti prāsādajagatī | 

agrataḥ pṛṣṭhataścaiva vāmadakṣiṇato'pivā | 
prāsādaṃ kārayedantarnābhivedhavivarjitam || 27 || 

liṅgāgre natu kartavyā arcārūpeṇa devatā | 
prabhā naṣṭā na bhogāya yathā tārā divākare || 28 || 

śivasyāgre śivaṃ kuryād brahmāṇaṃ brahmaṇo'grataḥ | 
viṣṇoragre bhavedviṣṇurjino jaine ravau raviḥ || 29 || 

brahmaviṣṇurekanābhirdvābhyāṃ doṣo na vidyate | 
śivasyāgre'nyadevasya dṛṣṭivedhe mahadbhayam || 30 || 

prasiddharājamārgasya prākārasyāntare'pivā | 
sthāpayedanyadevāṃśca tatra doṣo na vidyate || 31 || 

śivasnānodakaṃ gūḍhamārgaṃ caṇḍīmukhe kṣipet | 

pṛ0 8) dṛṣṭaṃ na laṅghayet tatra hanti puṇyaṃ purākṛtam || 32 || 

ekā caṇḍyā raveḥ sapta tisro dadyādvināyake | 
catasro vāsudevasya śivasyārdhā pradakṣiṇā || 33 || 

agrato jinadevasya stotramantrārcanādikam | 
kuryānna darśayetpṛṣṭhaṃ saṃmukhaṃ dvāralaṅghanam || 34 || 

pūrvāparāmukhadvāre praṇālaṃ śubhamuttare | 
iti śāstravicāro'yamuttareśānadevatāḥ || 35 || 

maṇḍape ye sthitā devāsteṣāṃ vāme ca dakṣiṇe | 
praṇālaṃ kārayeddhīmān jagatyāṃ ca caturdiśam || 36 || 

pūrvāparāsyaṃ devānāṃ kuryānno dakṣaṇottaram | 
brahmaviṣṇuśivārkendraguhāḥ pūrvāparāṅmukhāḥ || 37 || 

nagarābhimukhāḥ śreṣṭhā madhye bāhye ca devatāḥ | 
gaṇeśo dhanado lakṣmīḥ puradvāre sukhāvahāḥ || 38 || 

vighneśo bhairavaścaṇḍī nakulīśo grahāstathā | 
mātaro dhanadaścaiva śubhā dakṣiṇadiṅmukhāḥ || 39 || 

nirṛtyabhimukhaḥ kāryo hanumān vānareśvaraḥ | 
anye vidiṅmukhā devā na kartavyāḥ kadācana || 40 || 

iti devānāṃ dṛṣṭidoṣadigvibhāgaḥ | 

sūryādgaṇeśo viṣṇuśca caṇḍī śambhuḥ pradakṣiṇe || 41 || 

bhānogṛhe grahāstasya gaṇā dvādaśa mūrtayaḥ | 
śrīsūryaḥ . . . . . . . . . . . . | 
gaṇeśasya gṛhe tadvaccaṇḍī śaṃbhurharī raviḥ || 42 || 

mūrtayo dvādaśānye'pi gaṇāḥ sthāpyā hitāśca yeḥ | 

iti gaṇeśāyatanam || 43 || 

pṛ0 9) viṣṇoḥ pradakṣiṇenaiva gaṇeśo'rko'mbikā śivaḥ | 
sthāpyāstasthāvatārasya mūrtayo dvārakāṃ tathā || 44 || 

iti viṣṇovāyatanam | 

caṇḍyāḥ śaṃbhurgaṇeśo'rko viṣṇuḥsthāpyāḥ pradakṣiṇāḥ | 
mātaro mūrtayo devā yoginyo bhairavādayaḥ || 45 || 

iti caṇḍikāyatanam | 

śaṃbhoḥ sūryo gaṇeśaśca caṇḍī viṣṇuḥ pradakṣiṇe | 
sthāpyāḥ sarve śivasthāne dṛṣṭivedhavivarjitāḥ || 46 || 

iti śivāyatanam | 

rudrastripuruṣo madhye rudrādvāmagato hariḥ | 
dakṣiṇāṅge bhavedbrahmā viparyāse bhayāvahāḥ || 47 || 

rudravaktratribhāgena harirarddhe pitāmahaḥ | 
tattulyā pārvatīdevī sukhadā sarvakāmadā || 48 || 

iti tripuruṣanyāsaḥ || 

iti prāsādamaṇḍane jagatīdṛṣṭidoṣāyatanādhikāre dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ || 2 || 

atha tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ | 

atisthūlātivistīrṇā prāsādādhāriṇī śilā | 
atīva sudṛḍhā kāryā iṣṭikācūrṇavāribhiḥ || 1 || 

śilopari bhavedbhiṭṭamekahaste yugāṅgulam | 
ardhāṅgulā bhavedvṛddhiryāvaddhastaśatārdhakam || 2 || 

aṅgulenāṃśahīnena ardhenārdhena ca kramāt | 

pṛ0 10) pañcadig viṃśatiryāvacchatārdhaṃ ca vivardhayet || 3 || 

ekadvitrīṇi bhiṭṭāni hīnahīnāni kārayet | 
svasvodayapramāṇasya carturthāṃśena nirgamaḥ || 4 || 

iti bhiṭṭaḥ | 

pīṭhamardhaṃ tripādāṃśairevaṃ dvitrikare gṛhe | 
caturhaste trisārddhāṃśaṃ pādāṃśaṃ pañcahastake || 5 || 

daśaviṃśatiṣaṭtriṃśacśatārddhaṃ hastakāvadhi | 
vṛddhirvedatriyugmaikasaṃkhyā syādaṅgulaiḥ kramāt || 6 || 

pañcāṃśahīnamādhikyamekaikaṃ tu tridhā punaḥ | 
tripañcāśat samutsedhe dvāviṃtyaṃśanirgame || 7 || 

navāṃśo jāḍyakumbhaśca saptāṃśaṃ kaṇakaṃ bhavet | 
sāntarālaṃ kapotāliḥ saptāṃśā grāsapaṭṭikā || 8 || 

sūryadigvasubhāgaiśca gajavājinarāḥ kramāt | 
vājisthāne'thavā kāryaṃ svaṃ svaṃ devasya vāhanam || 9 || 

pañcāṃśā kaṇikāgre tu nirgamo jāḍyakumbhakam | 
trisārddhaṃ kaṇakaṃ sārddhaṃ caturbhirgrāsapaṭṭikā || 10 || 

kumbharāśca narā vedā rāmayugmāṃśanirgamaḥ | 
antarālamadhasteṣāmūrdhvārdhakarṇayugmakam || 11 || 

gajapīṭhaṃ vinā svalpadravye puṇyaṃ mahattaram | 
jāḍyakumbhaḥ kaṇālī ca grāsapaṭṭī tadā bhavet || 12 || 

kāmadaṃ kaṇapīṭhaṃ ca jāḍyakumbhaḥ kaṇālikā | 
latine nirgame hīne sādhāre nirgamādhikam || 13 || 

sarveṣāṃ pīṭhamādhāraḥ pīṭhahīnaṃ nirāśrayam | 
pīṭhahīnaṃ vināśāya prāsādabhuvanādikam || 14 || 

pṛ0 11) iti pīṭham | 

hastādipañcaparyantaṃ vistāreṇodayaḥ samaḥ | 
sa kramānnavasapteṣurāmacaṃdrauṅgulo'dhikaḥ || 15 || 

pañcādidaśaparyantaṃ triṃśadyāvacchatādhakam | 
haste haste kramādvṛddhirmanusūryanavāṅgulā || 16 || 

ekahastādipañcāntaṃ pṛthutvenodayaḥ samaḥ | 
haste sūryāṅgulā vṛddhiryāvattriṃśatkarāvadhi || 17 || 

navāṅgulā kare vṛddhiryāvaddhastaśatārddhakam |
pīṭhorddhe udayaścaiva chādyānte nāgarodhikam || 18 || 

ekaviṃśatpañcabhakteḥ prāsādasya samucchrayaḥ | 
pañcādinavabhāgāntaṃ pīṭhasya pañcadhodayaḥ || 19 || 

vedavedendubhakte tu chādyānte pīṭhamastakāt | 
khurakaḥ pañcabhāgaṃ syādviṃśatiḥkumbhakastathā || 20 || 

kalaśo'ṣṭau dvisārdhaṃ tu kartavyamantarālakam | 
kapotikāṣṭau mañcī syāt kartavyā navabhāgikā || 21 || 

pañcatriṃśatpadā jaṅghā tithyaṃśairudgamo bhavet | 
vasubhirbharaṇi kāryā śirāpaṭṭī daśāṃśikā || 22 || 

aṣṭāṃśordhvā kapotālirddhisārdhamantarālakam | 
chādyaṃ trayodaśāṃśoccaṃ daśabhāgairvinirgamaḥ || 23 || 

iti maṇḍovaraḥ | 

merumaṇḍovare mañcī bharaṇyūrddhe'ṣṭabhāgikā | 
pañcaviṃśatikā jaṅghā udagmaśca trayodaśa || 24 || 

aṣṭāṃśā bharaṇī śeṣaṃ pūrvavatkalpayetsudhī | 
saptabhāgā bhavenmañcī kūṭachādyasya mastake || 25 || 

pṛ0 12) ṣoḍaśāṃśā punarjaṅghā bharaṇī saptabhāgikā | 
śirāvaṭī caturbhāgā paṭṭaḥsyātpañcabhāgikaḥ || 26 || 

sūryāṃśaiḥ kūṭachādyañca sarvakāmaphalapradam | 
kumbhakasya yugāṃśena sthāvarāṇāṃ praveśakaḥ || 27 || 

iti merūmaṇḍovaraḥ | 

śirāvaṭyudgamo mañcī jaṅghārūpāṇi varjayet | 
alpadravye mahatpuṇyaṃ kathitaṃ viśvakarmaṇā || 28 || 

iti sāmānyamaṇḍovaraḥ | 

pīṭhataḥ chādyaparyantaṃ saptaviṃśatibhājite | 
dvādaśānāṃ khurādīnāṃ bhāgasaṃkhyā krameṇa tu || 29 || 

syādekavedasārdhāddhaṃ sārdhasyārddhāṣṭamistribhiḥ | 
sārddhasyārdhārdhabhāgaiḥ syāddvisārdhairdvyaṃśanirgamaḥ || 30 || 

iti prakārāntareṇa maṇḍovaraḥ | 

pādāṃśenaiṣṭaka pañcaṣaḍaṃśaiḥ śailadāruje | 
sādhāra'ṣṭāṃśato bhittirdaśāṃśairdhāturatnaje || 31 || 

madhye yugāsraṃ bhadrārddhā subhadraṃ pradibhadrakam | 
phālanīyaṃ garbhagṛha doṣadaṃ garbhamāyatam || 32 || 

kumbhakena samā kumbhī stambhaprāntaja udgamaḥ | 
bharaṇyā bharaṇaṃ śīrṣaṃ kapotālyā samaṃ bhavet || 33 || 

peṭake kaṭuchādyasya kuryātpaṭṭasya peṭakam | 
saṣaḍaṃśaḥ sapādasya sārdho garbhasya vistarāt || 34 || 

bṛhaddevālaye paṭṭe peṭāntaṃ hi tridhodayaḥ | 
bhavedaṣṭābhirekāṃśā kumbhastambho'rddhapañcabhiḥ || 35 || 

ardhena bharaṇi śīrṣamekaḥ paṭṭastu sārddhakam | 

pṛ0 13) vyāsārdhena karoṭaṃ syādarddhayoviṣamāśrutā || 36 || 

iti garbhagṛhodayapramāṇam | 

mūlakarṇaiśca sūtreṇa kumbhenodumbaraḥ samaḥ | 
tadadhaḥ pañcaratnāni sthāpayet śilpipūjanāt || 37 || 

dvāranyāse tribhāgena madhye mandārako bhavet | 
vṛttaṃ mandārakaṃ kuryāt mṛṇālaṃ padmasaṃyutam || 38 || 

jāḍyakumbhaḥ kaṇālī ca kīrtivaktra dvayaṃ tathā | 
udumbarasya pārśve ca śākhāyāṃ stalarūpakam || 39 || 

kumbhasyārdhe tribhāge vā pādehīna udumbaraḥ | 
taddvayaṃ kaṇakaṃ madhye pīṭhake bāhyabhūmikā || 40 || 

iti udumbaraḥ | 

khurakena samaṃ kuryādardhacandrasya cocchritiḥ | 
dvāravyāsasama dairghyaṃ nirgamañca tadardhataḥ || 41 || 

dvibhāgamardhacaṃdraṃ ca bhāgena dvau gagārakau | 
śaṅkhapatrasamāyuktaṃ padmākārairalaṅkṛtam || 42 || 

iti ardhacandraḥ | 

ekahaste tu prāsāde dvāraṃ syātṣoḍaśāṅgulam | 
ṣoḍaśāṅgulikā vṛddhiryāvaddhastacatuṣṭayam || 43 || 

aṣṭahastāntakaṃ yāvaddīrghe vṛddhirguṇāṅgulā | 
dvyaṅgulamatihastañca yāvaddhastaśatārdhakam || 44 || 

yāvad vāhanaparyaṅkadvāraṃ prāsādasadmanām | 
daidhyārdhena pṛthutve syācchobhanaṃ tatkalādhikam || 45 || 

iti nāgaraprāsādadvāram | 

ekahaste surāgāre dvāraṃ sūryāṅgulodayam | 

pṛ0 14) sūryāṅgulā pratikaraṃ vṛddhiḥpañcakarāvadhiḥ || 46 || 

pañcāṅgulā ca saptānta dvyaṅgulā tu śatārdhake | 
navāntaṃ syādyugāṅgulaṃ vṛddhiḥ kāryā karaṃ prati || 47 || 

iti bhūmije dvāram | 

prāsāde caikahaste tu ddhāraṃ kuryāddaśāṅgulam | 
rasahastāntakaṃ yāvat tāvatā vṛddhiriṣyate || 48 || 

pañcāṅgulāddaśāntaṃ ca dvayaṅgulaṃ vā śatārdhakam | 
. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . || 49 || 

iti drāviḍe dvāram | 

vimāne bhaumajaṃ mānaṃ virāṭeṣu tathaiva ca | 
miśrake latine caiva praśastaṃ nāgarodbhavam || 50 || 

vimānanagarachande kuryāt vimānapuṣpake | 
siṃhāvalokane dvāraṃ nāgaraṃ śobhanaṃ matam || 51 || 

valabhyāṃ bhaumajaṃ mānaṃ phāsākāreṣu drāviḍe | 
dhātuje ratnaje caiva dāruje ca rathāruhe || 52 || 

iti dvārapramāṇam | 

navaśākhaṃ maheśasya devānāṃ saptaśākhikam | 
pañcaśakhaṃ sāvabhaume triśākhaṃ maṇḍaleśvare || 53 || 

ekaśākhaṃ bhaveddvāraṃ vaiśye śūdre dvije sadā | 
samaśākhaṃ dhūmāya . . . śvānarāsabhavāyase || 54 || 

tripañcasaptanandāṅge śākhāḥsyuraṅgatulyakāḥ | 
hīnaśākhaṃ na kartavyamadhikārddhaṃ sukhāvaham || 55 || 

aṅgula sārdhamarddhañca kuryāddhīnaṃ tathādhikam | 
āpaddoṣaviśuddhyarthaṃ hrāso vṛddhirna duṣyati || 56 || 

pṛ0 15) caturbhāgāṅkitaṃ kuryāt śākhāvistāramānakam | 
madhye dvibhāgikaṃ kuryāt stambhaṃ puruṣasaṃjñakam || 57 || 

trisaṃjñakā bhavet śākhā pārśvato bhāgabhāgikā | 
nirgame caikabhāgena rūpastambhaḥ praśasyate || 58 || 

ekāṃśaṃ sārddhabhāgañca pādonadvayameva ca | 
dvibhāgaṃ nirgame kuryāt stambhaṃ dravyānusārataḥ || 59 || 

peṭake vistaraṃ kāryaṃ praveśastu yugāṃśakam | 
koṇikā stambhamadhye tu bhūṣaṇārthā hi pārśvataḥ || 60 || 

dvāradairghyacaturthāṃśe dvārapālo vidhīyate | 
stambhaṃ śākhādikaṃ śeṣe triśākhāvadvibhājayet || 61 || 

iti triśākham | 

patraśākhā ca gandharvā rūpastambhatṛtīyake | 
caturthī svalpaśākhā ca siṃhaśākhā ca pañcamī || 62 || 

iti pañcaśākhā | 

prathamā patraśākhā ca gandharvā rūpaśākhikā | 
caturthī stambhaśākhā ca rūpaśākhā ca pañcamī || 63 || 

ṣaṣṭhī tu śalyaśākhā ca siṃhaśākhā ca saptamī | 
stambhaśākhā bhavenmadhye rūpaśākhāgrasūtrataḥ || 64 || 

iti saptaśākhāḥ || 

patragandharvasaṃjñā ca rūpastambhatṛtīyake | 
caturthī śalyaśākhā ca gandharvā tvatha pañcamī || 65 || 

rūpastambhastathā ṣaṣṭhī rūpaśākhā tataḥ parā | 
śalyaśākhā ca siṃhākhyā mūlakarṇena saṃmitā || 66 || 

yasya devasya yā mūrtiḥ saiva kāryottarāṅgake | 

pṛ0 16) śākhāyāñca parīvāro gaṇeśaścottarāṅgake || 67 || 

iti navaśākhā | 

iti prāsādamaṇḍane vāstuśāstre pīṭhamaṇḍovaragarbhagṛha udumbarapramāṇaṃ tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ || 3 || 

atha caturtho'dhyāyaḥ | 

dvārocchrāyo'ṣṭanavadhā bhāgamekaṃ parityajet | 
śeṣe tryaṃśe dvibhāgārccā tryaṃśonā dvārato'thavā || 1 || 

dvāradairghye tu tithyaṃśo tithiśakrakalāṃśakaiḥ | 
ūrdhvārcā āsanasthā ca manuviśvārkabhāgataḥ || 2 || 

caturasrīkṛte kṣetre daśabhāgavibhājite |
bhittirdvibhāgā kartavyā ṣaṭbhāgaṃ garbhamandiram || 3 || 

tṛtīyāṃśena garbhasya prāsāde pratimottamā | 
madhyamā svadaśāṃśonā pañcāṃśonā kanīyasī || 4 || 

āyabhāgairmajeddvāramaṣṭamaṃ tūrddhatastyajet | 
saptame saptame dṛṣṭirvṛṣe siṃhe dhvaje śubhā || 5 || 

ṣaṣṭabhāgasya pañcāṃśo lakṣmīnārāyaṇādidṛk | 
śayanārceśaliṅgāni dvārārdhaṃ na vyatikramet || 6 || 

paṭṭādho yakṣabhūtādyāḥ paṭṭāgre sarvadevatāḥ | 
tadagre vaiṣṇavaṃ brāhmaṃ madhye liṅga śivasya ca || 7 || 

iti pratimāpramāṇadṛṣṭipadasthāpanam | 

chādyasyordhe prahāraḥ syāt śṛṅge śṛṅga tathaiva ca | 
prāsādaśṛṅgaśṛṅgeṣu adhobhāge tu chādyakam || 8 || 

pṛ0 17) chādyaṃ bhāgadvayaṃ sārddhaṃ sārddhabhāgaṃ ca pālavam | 
muṇḍalīkaṃ bhāgamekaṃ bhāgena tilakastathā || 9 || 

mūlakarṇe rathādau vā ekadvitrikramānnyaset | 
nirādhāre mūlabhittau sādhāre bhramabhittiṣu || 10 || 

uruśṛṅgāṇi bhadre syurekādigrahasaṃkhyayā | 
trayodaśorddhe saptārddhe luptāni coruśṛṅgakaiḥ || 11 || 

rekhāmūlena digbhāgaṃ kuryādagre ṣaḍaṃśakam | 
ṣaḍbāhye doṣadaṃ proktaṃ pañcamadhye na śobhanam || 12 || 

sapādaṃ śikharaṃ kāryaṃ sakarṇaṃ śikharodayam | 
sapādakarṇayormadhye udaye pañcaviṃśatiḥ || 13 || 

proktā rekhā kalābhedairvalaṇaiḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ | 
pañcādinavayugmāntaṃ khaṇḍāni teṣvanukramāt || 14 || 

aṃśavṛddhyā kalāḥ kāryā dairghye skandhe'pi tatsamāḥ  | 
aṣṭādāvaṣṭaṣaṣṭhyantaṃ caturvṛddhyā tu ṣoḍaśa || 15 || 

dairghyatulyāḥ kalāḥ skandhe ekahīnāstu ṣoḍaśa | 
ūrdhvā aṣṭadaśāṃśāḥ syustiryakṣoḍaśa eva ca || 16 || 

cakre'sminsaṃbhavantyeva rekhāṇāṃ ṣaṭśatadvayam | 
trikhaṃḍāt khaṇḍavṛddhiśca yāvadaṣṭādaśaiva hi || 17 || 

ekaikāṃśe kalāṣṭau ca samācārastu ṣoḍaśa | 
dvitīyaprathame khaṇḍe kalāṣṭau dvitīye nava || 18 || 

tṛtīye daśakhaṃḍeṣu śeṣeṣūrdhveṣvayaṃ kramaḥ | 
aṣṭadikṣu subhāgaiśca trikhaṇḍā tṛtīyā bhavet || 19 || 

anena kramayogena koṣṭhānaṅkaiḥ prapūrayet | 
rekhāṇāṃ jāyate saṃkhyā ṣaṭpañcāśacchatadvayam || 20 || 

pṛ0 18) savyāsaṃ śikharaṃ kāryaṃ sakarṇaṃ śikharodayam | 
vyāsasya karṇayormadhye rekhāḥ syuḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ || 21 || 

viṃśadbhirvibhajedbhāgaiḥ śilātaḥ kalaśāntakam | 
maṇḍo varo'ṣṭasārddhāṣṭanavāṃśaiḥ śikharodayam || 22 || 

rekhāmūlasya vistāre padmakośaṃ samālikhet | 
caturguṇena sūtreṇa sapādaḥ śikharodayaḥ || 23 || 

skandhakośāntare saptabhakte grīvātribhāgataḥ | 
sārdhamāmalasārañca padmapratrantu sārddhakam || 24 || 

tribhāga uccakalaśo dvibhāgaṃ tasya vistaram | 
prāsādasyāṣṭamāṃśena pṛthutvakalaśāṇḍake || 25 || 

chādyataḥ skandhaparyantamekaviṃśatibhājite | 
aṅkadigrudrasūryāṃśairviśvāṃśaistasya cocchrayaḥ || 26 || 

śukanāsasya saṃsthānaṃ chādyordhve prañcadhā matam | 
ekatripañcasaptāṅkasiṃhasthānāni kalpayet || 27 || 

dvārasya dakṣiṇe vāme kapilī ṣaṭvidhā matā | 
tadūrdhve śukanāsā syāt saiva prāsādanāsikā || 28 || 

prāsādo daśabhāgaśca dvitrivedāṃśasaṃmitā | 
prāsādenārddhapādena tribhāganātha nirmitā || 29 || 

śṛṅgoraśṛṅgapratyaṅgaiḥ khaṇḍakān gaṇayetsudhīḥ | 
tavāṅgaṃ tilakaṃ karṇe kuryātprāsādabhūṣaṇam || 30 || 

daśāṃśe śikharemūle agre tatra navāṃśake | 
sārdhāṃśakau rathau koṇau dvauśeṣaṃ bhadramiṣyate || 31 || 

rathayorubhayormadhye vṛttamāmalasārakam | 

pṛ0 19) utsedho vistarārdhena caturbhāgarvibhājayet || 32 || 

grīvā cāmalasāraśca pādonañca sapādakam | 
candrikābhāgamānena bhāgenāmalasārikā || 33 || 

ghṛtapātraṃ nyasenmadhye tāmrapātraṃ suvarṇajam | 
sauvarṇaṃ puruṣaṃ tatra tulī?paryaṅkaśāyinam || 34 || 

pramāṇaṃ puruṣaṃ sārdhāṅgulaṃ kuryātkaraṃ prati | 
tripatākaṃ kare vāme hṛdisthaṃ dakṣiṇa karam || 35 || 

prāsādapṛṣṭhadeśe tu dakṣiṇe pratirarthake | 
dhvajādhārastu kartavya īśāne nairṛte'thavā || 36 || 

iti prāsādasyorddhaṃ lakṣaṇam | 

kṣīrārṇavasamutpannaṃ prāsādasyāgrajātakam | 
māṅgalyeṣu ca sarveṣu kalaśaṃ sthāpayedbudhaḥ || 37 || 

pūrvoktamānato jyeṣṭhaḥ ṣoḍaśāṃśādhiko bhavet | 
grīvāpīṭhaṃ bhavedbhāgaṃ tribhāgenāṇḍakaṃ tathā || 38 || 

karṇikābhāgatulye ca tribhāgaṃ bījapūrakam | 
ekāṃśamagre dvau mūle vahnivedāṃśakarṇike || 39 || 

grīvā dvau pīṭhamardhaṃ dvau ṣaḍbhāgaṃ vistarāṇḍakam | 

iti kalaśaḥ | 

daṇḍastattṛtīyāṃśena śilāntakalaśāntakam || 40 || 

mardhyeṣṭāṃśena hīno'sau jyeṣṭhapādo'nyakanyasaḥ | 
prāsādapṛthumānena daṇḍo jyeṣṭhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 41 || 

madhyo hīno daśāṃśena pañcamāṃśena kanyasaḥ | 
ekahaste tu prāsāde daṇḍaḥ pādonamaṅgulam || 42 || 

kuryādardhāṅgulaṃ vṛddhiryāvatpañcadaśāhatam | 

pṛ0 20) suvṛttaḥ sāradāruśca granthikaṇṭakavarjitaḥ || 43 || 

parvabhirviṣamaiḥ kāryaḥsamagranthiḥ sukhāvahaḥ | 
daṇḍadīrghaṣaḍaṃśena markaṭya ? rdhenavistaraḥ || 44 || 

ardhacandrākṛtiḥ pārśve ghaṇṭa dve kalaśastathā | 
dhvajo daṇḍapramāṇena dhairghyeṃ'ṣṭāṃśena vistare || 45 || 

nānāvastravicitrāṇi tripañcāgraśikhopamā | 
pure ca nagare koṭṭe rathe rājagṛhe tathā || 46 || 

vāpīkūpataḍāgeṣu dhvajāḥ kāryāḥ suśobhanāḥ | 
niṣpannaṃ śikharaṃ dṛṣṭvā dhvajahīnaṃ na kārayet || 47 || 

asurā vāsamicchanti dhvajahīne surālaye | 
dhvajocchrāyeṇa tuṣyanti devāśca pitarastathā || 48 || 

daśāśvamedhikaṃ puṇyaṃ sarvatīrthadharādikam | 
pañcaśatpūrvataḥ paścādātmānañca tathādhikam || 49 || 

śatamekottaraṃ so'pi tārayennarakārṇavāt | 

iti dhvajalakṣaṇapuṇyādhikāraḥ | 

iti pratimādṛṣṭipadasthānaśikharadhvajakalaśalakṣaṇādhikāraścaturtho'dhyāyaḥ || 4 || 

atha pañcamo'dhyāyaḥ | 

nānāvidhamidaṃ viśvaṃ vicitraṃ yena sūtritam | 
sūtradhāraḥ sa eva syāt sarveṣāṃ pālanakṣamaḥ || 1 || 

nyūnādhikaṃ prasiddhañca yakiñcinmaṇḍanoditam | 
viśvakarmaprasādena śilpibhirmanyatāṃvacaḥ || 2 || 

pṛ0 21) caturbhāgaṃ samārabhya yāvatsūryottaraśatam | 
bhāgasaṃkhyeti vikhyātā phālanā karṇabāhyataḥ || 3 || 

aṣṭottaraśataṃ bhedā aṃśavṛddhayā bhavanti te | 
samāṃśairviṣamaiḥ kāryā nandamedaiśca phālanāḥ || 4 || 

ekasyāpi talasyordhve śikharāṇi bahūnyapi | 
nāmāni jātayasteṣāmūrdhvamārgānusārataḥ || 5 || 

daśahastādadho nāsti prāsādo bhramasaṃyutaḥ | 
navāṣṭadaśabhāgena bhramo bhittirvidhīyate || 6 || 

vairājyaścaturasrastu caturdvāracatuṣkikā | 
prāsādo brahmaṇaḥ prokto dhīmatā viśvakarmaṇā || 7 || 

sapādaṃ śikharaṃ kāryaṃ ghaṇṭākuliśabhūṣitam | 
caturbhiḥ śukanāsaistu siṃhakarṇairvirājitam || 8 || 

ekadvāraṃ bhavetpūrvaṃ dvidvāraṃ pūrvapaścimam | 
tridvāre madhyajaṃ dvāraṃ dakṣiṇāsyaṃ vivarjayet || 9 || 

caturdvāraṃ caturdikṣu śivabrahmajinālaye | 
homaśālā caturdvārā kvacidrājagṛhe tathā || 10 || 

vairājyādisamutpannāḥ prāsādā brahmaṇārcitāḥ | 
ekatripañcasaptāṅkaśākhāntaiḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ || 11 || 

caturbhakte bhavet koṇo bhāgo bhadraṃ dvibhāgikam | 
bhāgārdhaṃ nirgamaṃ bhadre prakuryānmukhabhadrakam || 12 || 

śṛṅgamekaṃ bhavet karṇe dve dve bhadre ca nandanam | 

iti nandanam | 

tathācoktam | 
mukhabhadre patibhadramudgamo rathikopari || 13 || 

pṛ0 22) karṇaśṛṅge siṃhakarṇaṃ siṃhanāmā sa ucyate | 
devānāṃ tu prakartavyaṃ siṃhastatraiva śāśvataḥ || 14 || 

tuṣyate girijā tasya saubhāgyadhanaputrakaiḥ | 
rathikāṃ siṃhakarṇaṃ ca bhadre śṛṅge ca siṃhakaḥ || 15 || 

iti siṃhaḥ | 

karṇe śṛṅgaṃ tu pañcāṇḍakaśrīnandana ucyate | 
agā iti ṣaḍbhāgaiśca caturasraṃ vibhājayet || 16 || 

karṇaṃ pratirathaṃ kuryādbhadrārddhaṃ bhāgabhāgikam | 
samanirgamamasmācca bhadraṃ bhāgārddhanirgamaḥ || 17 || 

dve dve karṇe tathā bhadre caikaṃ ca pratirathyakam | 
mandiraṃ tṛtīyaṃ bhadramalayorbhadrajaṃ tyajet || 18 || 

pratyekaṃ tilakaṃ kuryāt pratirathye vimānakaḥ | 
bhadroruśṛṅgavaiśālapratirathye subhūṣaṇaḥ || 19 || 

iti pañcāṅgāḥ pañca | 

caturasre'ṣṭabhirbhakte karṇe pratirathaṃ ratham | 
bhadrārdhaṃ bhāgabhāgaṃ ca bhāgārdhena vinirgamam || 20 || 

vārimārgāntarayutā rathāśca tulyanirgamāḥ | 
śṛṅgayugme ca tilakaṃ karṇe dve pratirathyakaḥ || 21 || 

ekaṃ coparathe bhadre trīṇi tritricaturdiśam | 
śikharaṃ pañcavistāraṃ mahendro rājyado nṛṇām || 22 || 

karṇe śṛṅgatrayaṃ śeṣaṃ pūrvavadratra śīrṣakam | 
tyaktvaikaśṛṅgabhadrasya matālambaṃ na kārayet || 23 || 

mastake tasya cchādyasya śṛṅgayugmaṃ pradāpayet | 
sitaśṛṅgastadā nāma īśvarasya sadā priyaḥ || 24 || 


pṛ0 23) tilakaṃ coparathya tu bhūdharo nāma nāmataḥ | 
chādyaśṛṅge tu tilakaṃ nāmnā bhuvanamaṇḍanaḥ || 24*** || [ṣhloka numbering mistake found from here like 23, 61, 24 then 25 and continu..] 

śṛṅgadvayaṃ coparathe tilakaṃ kārayet sudhīḥ | 
trailokyavijayo bhadraśṛṅge na kṣitivallabhaḥ || 25 || 

iti saptāṅgaḥ | 

daśabhāgakṛte kṣetre bhadrārdhaṃ bhāgamānataḥ | 
trayaṃ pratirathaḥ karṇe bhāgo bhāgasamo bhavet || 26 || 

karṇe pratirathe bhadre dve dve śṛṅge prakārayet | 
rathoparathe tilakaṃ pratyaṅgaṃ ca rathopari || 27 || 

matātna(la)mbayutaṃ bhadraṃ prāsādo'yaṃ mahīdharaḥ | 
bhadre śṛṅgaṃ tṛtīyaṃ ca kailāso nāma nāmataḥ || 28 || 

bhadraṃ tyaktvā rathe śṛṅgaṃ navamaṅgala ucyate | 
tathā bhadre punardadyāt tadāsau gandhamādanaḥ || 29 || 

bhadre tyaktvā coparathe śṛṅgaṃ sarvāṅgasundaraḥ | 
bhadre dadyāt punaḥ śṛṅge vijayānanda ucyate || 30 || 

matālambayutaṃ bhadramuruśṛṅgaṃ parityajet | 
śṛṅgadvayaṃ ca cchādyordhve sarvāṅgatilakastadā || 31 || 

uruśṛṅgaṃ tato dadyānmatālambasamanvitam | 
mahābhāgastadā nāma sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ || 32 || 

karṇe pratirathe rathe caikaṃ taparathādiṣu | 
meruścāpi samākhyātaḥ sarvadeveṣu pūjitaḥ || 33 || 

pradakṣiṇātraye svarṇamerau puṃsāṃ ca yat phalam | 
iṣṭakāśailajāmerutatphalaṃ pradakṣiṇākṛte || 34 || 

vairājyapramukhā ye'tra nāgarā brahmaṇoditāḥ | 

pṛ0 24) iti vairājyādiprāsādapañcaviṃśatyadhikāre pañcamo'dhyāyaḥ || 5 ||  

atha ṣaṣṭho'dhyāyaḥ | 

kesarī sarvatobhadro nandano nandiśālakaḥ | 
nandīśo mandaraścaiva śrīvṛkṣaścāmṛtodbhavaḥ || 1 || 

himavān hemakūṭaśca kailāsaḥ pṛthivījayaḥ | 
indranīlo mahānīlo bhūdharo ratnakūṭakaḥ || 2 || 

vaidūryaḥ padmarāgaśca vajrako mukuṭojjvalaḥ | 
airāvato rājahaṃso garuḍo vṛṣabhadhvajaḥ || 3 || 

meruḥ prāsādarājaśca devānāmālayo hi saḥ | 
brahmaviṣṇuśivārkāṇāmanyeṣāṃ na kadācana || 4 || 

ādyaḥ pañcāṇḍako deyaḥ kisarī nāma nāmataḥ | 
caturṇāṃ kramato vṛddhiryāvadekottaraṃ śatam || 5 || 

kṣetre'ṣṭāṃśe vibhakte tu karṇo bhāgadvayaṃ bhavet | 
bhadrārdhaṃ karṇatulyaṃ ca bhāgenaikena nirgamaḥ || 6 || 

daśāṃśe sārdhabhāgaṃ ca bhadrārdhaṃ ca pratirathe | 
karṇo dvibhāgaḥ sūryāṃśe bhadrārdhaṃ pratirathake || 7 || 

caturdaśavibhakte tu karṇordhvaṃdvādaśāṃśavat | 
bhadrapārśvadvaye kāryā bhāgabhāgena nandikā || 8 || 

ṣoḍaśāṃśe prakartavyaḥ karṇaḥ pratirathe'ntare | 
koṇikā bhāgatulyā ca śeṣaṃ caturdaśāṃśavat || 9 || 

catusrīkṛte kṣetre viṃśatyaṃśavibhājite | 

pṛ0 25) karṇo dvibhāgaḥ koṇī ca sārddhāṃśā pṛthuvistaraiḥ || 10 || 

dvibhāgastu pratiratho nandikā sārddhabhāgikā | 
bhadranaṃdī bhavedbhāgā bhadrārdhaṃ yugmabhāgikam || 11 || 

dvāviṃśatyaṃśake naṃdī bhāgaikā bhadrapārśvayoḥ | 
trayaḥ pratirathāḥ karṇe bhadrārdhaṃ ca dvibhāgikam || 12 || 

ekadvitri trikaṃ trīṇi vedāścatvāri pañca ca | 
taleṣu kramato'ṣṭāsu ke'pyāhuḥ śikharāṇi hi || 13 || 

aṣṭādaśāṃśabhadrasya pārśve dve dve ca nandike | 
kartavyairbhāgabhagaiśca śeṣaṃ syātṣoḍaśāṃśavat || 14 || 

śikharaṃ tvekavaidaikaṣaṭtrivedayugadvayam | 
taleṣu kramataḥ prokto mūlasūtre parājite || 15 || 

taleṣvaṣṭāsu vihitāḥ prāsādāḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ | 
trayastrayaḥ krameṇaiva catvāraścāṣṭame tale || 16 || 

trīṇi trīṇi svakīyāni dve dve paraḥ parasya ca | 
śikharāṇi vidheyāni viśvakarmavaco yathā || 17 || 

dvitryekaṣaṭtrayo'ṣṭāditaleṣu pañcasu kramāt | 
saptaiva saptame ṣaṣṭhe śirāṃsi trīṇi cāṣṭame || 18 || 

bhedāḥ pañcāśadekaikaṃ proktāḥ śrīviśvakarmaṇā | 
tenaikasmiṃstale'pi syuḥ śikharāṇi bahūnyapi || 19 || 

rathikāṃ siṃhakarṇaṃ ca bhadre kuryādgavākṣakān | 
pratyaṅgaistilakāḍhyaiśca śobhitaṃ suramandiram || 20 || 

prāsādāḥ kesarimukhāḥ sarvadeveṣu pūjitāḥ | 
purarājñoḥ prajādīnāṃ kartuḥ kalyāṇakārakāḥ || 21 || 

iti kesaryādiprāsādāḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ | 

pṛ0 26) ṣaṭtriṃśatkarato'dhastādyāvaddhastacatuṣṭayam | 
vinā bhramairnirādhārāḥ kartavyāḥ śāntimicchatā || 22 || 

vāstoḥ pañcavidhaṃ kṣetraṃ caturasramathāyatam | 
vṛttaṃ vṛttāyata caivāṣṭāsraṃ devāyalādiṣu || 23 || 

vistāre tu caturbhāgamāyāme pañcabhāgikam | 
ūrdhvaṃ? tikalaśānāṃ kuryāt pṛṣṭhyagre siṃhakarṇakam || 24 || 

vṛttāyataṃ prakartavyaṃ vyāsārdhaṃ vāmadakṣiṇe | 
karṇayorbhrāmayet vṛttaṃ vṛttaṃ bhadrāṇi cāṣṭa hi || 25 || 

prāsādo vartulāṣṭāsraḥ prāyeṇaikāṇḍakaḥ śubhaḥ | 
karṇe vā śreṇayo'ṇḍānāṃ maṇḍapaṃ tatsvarūpakam || 26 || 

iti pañca kṣetrāṇi | 

vicitrairupasaṃghātairbhadrairgavākṣabhūṣitaiḥ | 
vitānaphālanāśṛṅgairanekairnāgarā matāḥ || 27 || 

pīṭhopari bhavedvedī pīṭhāni trīṇi pañca ca | 
pīṭhato drāviḍe rekhā latāśṛṅgādisaṃyutā || 28 || 

bhūmikopari bhūmiśca hrasvārarka navāntakam | 
vibhaktidalasaṃyuktā mūrdhni śṛṅgeṇa bhūmijā || 29 || 

śṛṅgeṇaikena lanitā śrīvatsā vārisaṃyutā | 
nāgarā bhramasaṃyuktāḥ sādhārāste prakīrtitāḥ || 30 || 

iti prāsādānāṃ jātayaḥ | 

pañcahasto bhavenmerurekottaraśatāṇḍakaḥ | 
bhedāḥ pañconapañcāśatkaravṛddhyā bhavanti te || 31 || 

haste haste bhavet dvirdvirhyaṇḍakānāṃ ca viṃśatiḥ | 
ekottarasahasraṃ syāt śṛṅgāṇāṃ ca śatārddhake || 32 || 

pṛ0 27) kesaripramukhāḥ karṇe vimānaṃ coruśṛṅgakam | 
tathaiva mūlaśikharaṃ pañcabhūmivimānakam || 33 || 

vimānaṃ nāgarā jātistadā prājñairudāhṛtā | 
ekaśṛṅgeṣu śṛṅgāṇi saṃbhavanti bahūnyapi || 34 || 

śrīmerupṛṣṭhabhāgaḥ syādekottaraśatāṇḍakaḥ | 
himaśīrṣo daśāṃśaḥ syāt yugasārdhaśatāṇḍake || 35 || 

bhāgairdvādaśabhiryuktaḥ sārddhadvitsena? saṃyutaḥ | 
suravallabhanāmā tu proktaḥ śrīviśvakarmaṇā || 36 || 

koṇe dvibhāga ekāṃśā koṇī sārddhapratīrathaḥ | 
ardhāṃśā nandikā bhadre sādhabhāgena saṃmitam || 37 || 

triśataṃ pañcasaptatyādhikaṃ yasyāṇḍakāni hi | 
bhaktaścaturdaśāṃśaistu nāmnā bhuvanamaṇḍanaḥ || 38 || 

koṇakoṇī pratiratho nandī bhadrārdhameva ca | 
dvyekadvyarddhāṃśe sārddhāśaiścaturdaśavibhājite || 39 || 

bāṇaikavedayugmāṃśā vedāḥ karṇādibhāgataḥ | 
ratnaśīrṣo bhavenmeruḥ pañcāśataikaśṛṅgakaiḥ || 40 || 

guṇaikayugmacandrādau purāṇāṃśavibhājite | 
kiraṇodbhavameruśca sapādaḥ ṣaṭśatāṇḍakaḥ || 41 || 

rāmacandradviyugmāṃśanetre viṃśatibhājite | 
nāmnā kamalahaṃsaḥ syātsārddha**saptaśatāṇḍakaḥ || 42 || 

bhāgaikanirgamā bhittirvedasārddha**trisārdhakaiḥ | 
dvābhyāṃ tai svarṇaketuśca pañcasaptāṣṭaśṛṅgakaiḥ || 43 || 

saṃbhramo bhramahīnaśca mahāmerubhramadvayam | 
sādhāreṣu prakartavyaṃ bhadre bhadrāvilokanam || 44 || 

pṛ0 28) vedaikarāmayugmāṃśanetre jinavibhājite | 
vṛṣabhadvajameruśca saikāṇḍakasahasravān || 45 || 

saṃbhramo bhramahīnaśca mahāmerubhramadvayam | 
sādhāreṣu prakartavyaṃ bhadre bhadrāvilokanam || 46 || 

rājñaśca prathamo merustato hīno'nyavarṇajaḥ | 
vinā rājño'nyavarṇena kṛte merau mahābhayam || 47 || 

iti navamerulakṣaṇam | 

iti kesaryādiprāsādajātilakṣaṇe pañcacatvāriṃśanmerulakṣaṇe ṣaṣṭho'dhyāyaḥ || 6 || 

atha saptamo'dhyāyaḥ | 

ratnagarbhāṅkanaṃ sūryacandratārāvitānakam | 
vicitraṃ maṇḍapaṃ yena kṛtaṃ tasmai namaḥ sadā || 1 || 

karṇagūḍho vilokyaḥ syādekatridvārasaṃyutāḥ | 
prāsādāgre prakartavyāḥ sarvadeveṣu maṇḍapāḥ || 2 || 

gūḍhastrīkāstathā nṛtyakrameṇa maṇḍapāstrayaḥ | 
jinasyāgre prakartavyāḥ sarveṣāṃ tu balāṇakam || 3 || 

samaṃ sapādaṃ prāsādātsārddhapādonataddvayam | 
dviguṇaṃ vā prakartavyāḥ maṇḍapāḥ pañcadhā matāḥ || 4 || 

samaṃ sapādaṃ pañcāśatparyantaṃ daśahastakam | 
daśāntaṃ pañcataḥ sārddhadvipādonaṃ catuṣkare || 5 || 

trihaste dviguṇaṃ dvyekahaste kuryāccatuṣkikām | 
prāyeṇa maṇḍapaṃ sārddhaṃ dviguṇaṃ pratyalindakaiḥ || 6 || 

pṛ0 29) maṇḍape staṃbhapaṭṭārthamadhyapaṭṭānusārataḥ | 
śukanāsā samā ghaṇṭā nyūnā śreṣṭhā nacādhikā || 7 || 

mukhamaṇḍapasaṅghāto padā bhittyantare bhavet | 
na doṣaḥstaṃbhapādādyaiḥ samaṃ vā viṣamaṃ talam || 8 || 

navāṣṭadaśabhāgeṣu tribhiścandrāvalokanam | 
hastakamaṅgulonaṃ vā tadūrdhvaṃ mattavāraṇam || 9 || 

sārddhaṃ pañcāṃśakairbhaktaiḥ sapādaṃ rājasenakam | 
sapādaṃ tryaṃśakā vedirbhāgenāsanapeṭakam || 10 || 

tadūrdhvaṃ saptasārddhāṃśe yāvatpaṭṭasya peṭakam | 
sārddhapañcāṃśakaiḥ staṃbhaḥ pādonaṃ bharaṇaṃ bhavet || 11 || 

bhāgārdhaṃ bharaṇaṃ cāpi sapādaṃ sārdhataḥ śaraḥ | 
pādo dvibhāgastasyorddhe kartavyaśchādyakodayaḥ || 12 || 

tribhāge talataḥ śchādyaṃ tatpeṭaṃ paṭṭapeṭake | 
ardhāṃśorddhā kapotālirdvibhāge paṭṭavistare || 13 || 

prāsādadaśarudrākṣaḥ bhāgena staṃbhavistaraḥ | 
va**dāṣṭaraviviṃśatyā karṇe vṛttastu pañcadhā || 14 || 

dvārāgre stambhavedyādyā prāggrīvo maṇḍapo bhavet | 
dvidvistaṃbhavivṛddhyā ca ṣoḍaśo'yaṃ prakīrtitaḥ || 15 || 

bhittiḥ prāsādavadgehe maṇḍape'ṣṭavidheṣu ca | 
caturasraśubhastasya tathā pratirathānvitaḥ || 16 || 

mukhabhadrayuto vāpi dvitripratirathairyutaḥ | 
karṇodakāntareṇātha bhadrodakavibhūṣitaḥ || 17 || 

karṇato dviguṇaṃ bhadraṃ pādonapratirarthakam | 
bhadrārdhaṃ mukhabhadraṃ ca śeṣaṃ ṣaṭvasubhājite || 18 || 

pṛ0 30) dalenārdhena pādena dalasya nirgamo bhavet | 
mūlaprāsādavad brāhme pīṭhajaṅghādimekhalā || 19 || 

gavākṣenānvitaṃ bhadramatha jālakasaṃyutam | 
guhaśca karṇaguhe vā bhadre candrāvalokanam || 20 || 

tridvāre caikacaktre'tha mukhe kāryā catuṣkikā | 
guhe prakāśake vṛddhamardhodayakaroṭakam || 21 || 

ityaṣṭagūḍhamaṇḍapāḥ || 

ekatrivedasaptāṅkacatuṣkāśca trikaṃ traye | 
ardhabhādraṃ vibhāgena pārśvayoragratastathā || 22 || 

agratasricatuṣkasya tathā pārśve dvaye'pi ca | 
muktakoṇe catuṣke dve iti dvādaśamaṇḍapāḥ || 23 || 

guhasyāgre prakartavyāstathā nānācatuṣkikā | 
caturasrādibhedena vitānairbahubhiryutā || 24 || 

iti dvādaśamaṇḍapāḥ | 

trikāgre raṅgabhūmātha tatra vai nṛtyamaṇḍapāḥ | 
saptaviṃśatiruktā ye maṇḍapā viśvakarmaṇā || 25 || 

talaistu viṣamaistulyaiḥ kṣaṇaiḥ stambhaiḥ samaistathā | 
prathamo dvādaśastaṃbho dvidvistaṃbhavivardhanāt || 26 || 

yāvatṣaṣṭicaturyuktāḥ saptaviṃśatimaṇḍapāḥ | 
kṣetrārdhasya ṣaḍaṃśonā caikāsrāṣṭāsramucyate || 27 || 

kalāsre kṣetraṣaḍbhāgastatṣaḍaṃśena saṃyutaḥ | 
aṣṭāsre ṣoḍaśāsre ca vṛttaṃ kuryāttadūrdhvataḥ || 28 || 

udayaṃ vistarārddhena taṃ ṣaṃdyaṃvāśabhājayet? | 
karṇadardarikā saptabhāgena nirgamo tucchatā || 29 || 

pṛ0 31) rūpakaṇṭhaṃ tu pañcāṃśaṃ dvibhāgenātra nirgamam | 
vidyādharaiḥ samāyuktaṃ ṣoḍaśāṣṭadivākaraiḥ || 30 || 

jinasaṃkhyāmitairvāpi dantatulyairvirājataiḥ | 
vidyādharaḥ pṛthutvena saptāṃśo nirgamodayaḥ || 31 || 

tadūrdhve citrarūpāśca nartakyo nṛtyaśobhitāḥ | 
gajatālastu ṣaṭsārddhā prathamā dvitīyā tu ṣaṭ || 32 || 

tṛtīyā sārdhapañcāṃśā kolāni trīṇi pañca ca | 
madhye vitānaṃ kartavyaṃ citravarṇavirājitam || 33 || 

nāṭakādikathārūpairnānākārarvirājitam | 
ekādaśaśatānyeva vitānānāṃ trayodaśa || 34 || 

śuddhasaṃghāṭamiśrāṇi kṣiptākṣiptāni yānica | 
vitānāni vicitrāṇi vastracitrādibhedataḥ || 35 || 

tāni loke pravartante tasmādūdhnanilokataḥ? | 
maṇḍapeṣu ca sarveṣu pīṭhānte raṅgabhūmikā || 36 || 

kuryād tānapādena? citrapāṣāṇajena ca | 

iti maṇḍapāḥ || 

balāṇadevagehāgre rājadvāre gṛhe pure | 
jalāśaye'tha kartavyaṃ sarveṣāṃ mukhamaṇḍapam || 37 || 

jagatīpādavistīrṇaṃ pādapādena varjitam | 
śālāpādena garbheṇa prāsādena samaṃ bhavet || 38 || 

uttame kanyasaṃ madhye madhyaṃ jyeṣṭhe tu kanyasam | 
ekadvitricatuḥpañcarasasaptapadāntare || 39 || 

mūlaprāsādavaddvāraṃ maṇḍape ca balāṇake | 

pṛ0 32) nyūnādhikaṃ na kartavyaṃ dairghye hastāṅgulādikam || 40 || 

peṭakaṃ cottarāṅgānāṃ sarveṣāṃ samasūtrataḥ | 
aṅgaṇā tu samaṃ peṭaṃ jagatyāścāntarāṅgajam || 41 || 

jagatyagre catuṣkīyāṃ vāmanaṃ tadvalāṇakam | 
vāme'tha? dakṣiṇadvārādvādikā mattavāraṇam || 42 || 

ūrdhvā bhūmiḥ prakartavyā nṛtyamaṇḍapasūtrataḥ | 
mattavāraṇakaṃ vedī vitānatoraṇairyutā || 43 || 

rājadvāre balāṇe ca pañca vā saptabhūmikā | 
dadvimānaṃ budhaiḥ proktaṃ puṣkaraṃ vārimadhyataḥ || 44 || 

harmyarājagṛhe vāpi kartavyaṃ gopurāmitaḥ | 
ekabhūmau tribhūmyantaṃ gṛhadvārasya mastake || 45 || 

iti pañcavidhabalāṇakam | 

saṃvarṇañca prakartavyaṃ prathamā pañcaghaṇṭikā | 
caturghaṇṭābhivṛddhyā ca yāvadekottaraṃ śatam || 46 || 

pañcaviṃśatirityuktā prathamā vasubhāgikā | 
vedottaraśataṃ yāvat vedāṃśā vṛdviriṣyate || 47 || 

bhadrārdhe rathikārdhena tavaṅgaṃ vāmadakṣiṇe | 
ardhodayena rathikā ghaṇṭākūṭaṃ tavaṅgakam || 48 || 

kalākūṭānvitā pūrvā pañcabhiḥ kalaśairyutaḥ | 
bhāgatulyaistathā siṃhairevamanyāśca lakṣitāḥ || 49 || 

iti maṇḍapasyordhvasaṃvarṇāḥ || 

iti śrīmaṇḍapabalāṇakaṃ saṃvarṇādhikāraḥ saptamo'dhyāyaḥ || 7 || 

pṛ0 33) atha aṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ | 

atha sādhāraṇo'dhyāyaḥ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutaḥ | 
viśvakarmaprasādena viśeṣeṇa prakathyate || 1 || 

mānaṃ nyūnādhikaṃ vāpi svayambhūbāṇaratnaje | 
ghaṭiteṣu vidhātavyamarcāliṅgeṣu śāstrataḥ || 2 || 

bahusamaṃ sandhiśiro guruḥ . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | 
svaśalyaṃ pādahīnaṃ tu tacca vāstu vinaśyati || 3 || 

anyavāstucite dravye hyanyavāstuniveśite | 
prāsāde na bhavetpūjā gṛhe tu na va . . . . tpattiḥ || 4 || 

svasthāne saṃsthitaṃ yacca vipravāstu śivālayam | 
acālyaṃ sarvadeśeṣu cālite rāṣṭravibhramaḥ || 5 || 

vāpīkūpataḍāgāni prāsādabhavanāni ca | 
jīrṇānyuddharate yastu puṇyamaṣṭaguṇaṃ labhet || 6 || 

tadrūpaṃ tatpramāṇaṃ syātpūrvasūtraṃ na cālayet | 
hīne tu jāyate hāniradhike tu dhanakṣayaḥ || 7 || 

vāstudravyādhikaṃ kuryātkāṣṭhaje śailaje'pi vā | 
śailaje dhātuje caiva dhātuje ratnaje'thavā || 8 || 

pūrvottaradiśa mūhamūhaṃ paścimadakṣiṇe | 
tatra mūhamamūhaṃ vā yatra tīrthaṃ samāhitam || 9 || 

siddhāyatanatīrtheṣu nadīnāṃ saṅgameṣu ca | 
svayambhūbāṇaliṅgeṣu tatra doṣo na vidyate || 10 || 

avyaktaṃ mṛnmaya cālyaṃ trihastāntaṃ tu śailajam | 
dārujaṃ puruṣārthaṃ ca ata ūdhvaṃ na cālayet || 11 || 

pṛ0 34) viṣamasthānamāśritya bhagnaṃ yatsthāpitaṃ suraiḥ | 
tatra sthānasthitā devā bhagnāḥ pūjāphalapradāḥ || 12 || 

yadyathā sthāpitaṃ vāstu tattathaiva hi kārayet | 
avyaṅgaṃ cālitaṃ nṝṇāṃ dāruṇaṃ kurute bhayam || 13 || 

arthataścālataḥ prajñāṃ jīrṇavyaṅgaṃ ca dūṣitam | 
ācāryaḥ śilpibhiḥ prājñaiḥ śāstradṛṣṭyāsamuddharet || 14 || 

svarṇajaṃ raupyajaṃ vāpi kuryānnāgamatho vṛṣaḥ | 
tasya śṛṅgeṇa dantena patitaṃ pātayetsudhiḥ || 15 || 

iti jīrṇoddhāravidhiḥ || 

tandulaṃ jālakaṃ caiva kīlakaṃ suśiraṃ tathā | 
chidrasandhiśca kārāśca mahādoṣā iti smṛtāḥ || 16 || 

bhinna doṣakara yasmātprāsādamaṭhamandiram | 
śikhābhirjālakairdvārai raśmivātaprabhedidam || 17 || 

brahmaviṣṇuśivārkāṇāṃ bhinnaṃ doṣakaraṃ na hi | 
jinagaurīgaṇeśānāṃ gṛhaṃ bhinnaṃ vivarjayet || 18 || 

vyaktāvyaktaṃ gṛhaṃ kuryād bhinnaṃ bhinnānumūrtikam | 
atha svāmiśarīraṃ syātprāsādamapi tādṛśam || 19 || 

iti bhinnadoṣāḥ | 

bhinnaṃ caturvidhaṃ jñeyamavṛddhāmiśrakaṃ matam | 
miśrakaṃ pūjitaṃ tatra bhinnaṃ vai doṣakāraṇam || 20 || 

chandobhedo na kartavyo jātibhedastathā punaḥ | 
utpadyate mahāmarma jātibhede kṛte sati || 21 || 

dvārahīne hareccakṣurnālahīne dhanakṣayam | 
apadasthāpite stambhe mahārogaṃ vinirdiśet || 22 || 

pṛ0 35) stambhavyāsodaye hīne kartā tatra vinaśyati | 
prāsāde pīṭhahīne tu naśyanti gajavājinaḥ || 23 || 

rathoparathahīne tu kartā tatra vinaśyati | 
prāsāde pīṭhahīne tu naśyanti gajavājinaḥ || 24 || 

rathoparathahīne tu prajāpīḍāṃ vinirdiśet | 
karṇahīne surāgāre phalaṃ tatra na vidyate || 25 || 

jaṅghāhīne haredbandhūn kartṛkān kārakādikān | 
śikhare hīnamāne tu putrapautradhanakṣayaḥ || 26 || 

atidīrghe kulacchedo hrasve vyādhisamudbhavaḥ | 
tasmācchāstrīyamānena sukhadaṃ sarvakāmadam || 27 || 

jagatyāṃ ropayecchālāṃ śālāyāṃ caiva maṇḍapam | 
maṇḍapena ca prāsādo grasto vai doṣakārakaḥ || 28 || 

iti doṣāḥ | 

prāsādocchrāyavistārājjagatī vāmadakṣiṇe | 
chāyābhedena kartavyā tathā liṅgasya pīṭhikā || 29 || 

jagatyāṃ tricatuḥṣpañcaguṇaṃ devapuraṃ tridhā | 
ekadvivedasāhasrahastaiḥ syādrājamandiram || 30 || 

kalāṣṭavedasāhastrairhastai rājapuraṃ samam | 
dairghyatulyaṃ sapādāṣṭaṃ sārdhāṃśenādhikaṃ śubham || 31 || 

dvādaśa tripurāṇi syurdevasthānāni cottare | 
ṣaṭtriṃśat ṣaṭvivṛdhyā ca yāvadekottaraṃ śatam || 32 || 

puraṃ prāsādagehaḥ syātsaudhairjālagavākṣakaiḥ | 
kīrtistambhairjalārāmairgehairmaṇḍaiḥ suśobhitam || 33 || 

iti devapurarājapurāṇi || 

pṛ0 36) prāsādasyottare yāmye tathāgnau paścime'pi ca | 
yadi nāmāśramaṃ kuryātsatataṃ dvitribhūmikam || 34 || 

dviśālaṃ madhya ṣaṭdārupaṭṭaśālāgraśobhitam | 
mattavāraṇamagre ca tadūrdhvaṃ paṭṭabhūmiṣu || 35 || 

koṣṭhāgāraṃ ca vāyavye vahnibhāge mahānasam | 
puṣyagehaṃ tatheśāne nairṛtyeśāntamāyudham || 36 || 

chātrāgāraṃ ca purato vāruṇyāṃ ca jalāśrayam | 
maṭhasyoparitaḥ kuryādvidyāvyākhyānamaṇḍapam || 37 || 

iti maṭhaḥ || 

pūrvoktā ........ puṇyāhapratiṣṭhā sarvasiddhidā | 
raveḥ saumyāyane kuryāddevānāṃ sthāpanādikam || 38 || 

pratiṣṭhā cottarāmūla ārdrāyāṃ ca punarvasau | 
puṣye haste mṛge svātau rauhiṇyāṃ śrutimaitrabhe || 39 || 

tithiṃ riktāṃ kujaṃ dhiṣṇyaṃ krūraṃ vidhuyutaṃ tathā | 
dagdhāṃ tithiṃ ca gaṇḍāntaṃ cārabhopagrahaṃ tyajet || 40 || 

sudine sumuhūrte ca lagne saumyayutekṣite | 
abhiṣekaḥ pratiṣṭhā ca praveśādikamiṣyate || 41 || 

prāsādāgre tathaiśāne uttare maṇḍapaṃ śubham | 
tripañcasaptanandaikādaśaviśvakarānanam || 42 || 

maṇḍapaḥ syātkarairaṣṭādaśasūryakalāmitaiḥ | 
ṣoḍaśa hastataḥ kuṇḍa vaśādadhika iṣyate || 43 || 

stambhaiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiryuktaṃ toraṇādivirājitam | 
maṇḍapaṃ vedikāmadhye pañcāṣṭanavakuṇḍakam || 44 || 

hastamātraṃ bhavetkuṇḍaṃ mekhalāyonisaṃyutam | 

pṛ0 37) āgamairvedamantraiśca homaṃ kuryādvidhānataḥ || 45 || 

ayutaṃ hastamātre ca lakṣārdhe tu dvihastakam | 
trihastaṃ lakṣahome syāddaśalakṣe catuṣkaram || 46 || 

viṃśalakṣe pañcahastaṃ koṭyardhaṃ ṣaṭkaraṃ matam | 
aśītilakṣe'drikaraṃ koṭihome'ṣṭahastakam || 47 || 

grahapūjāvidhāne ca kuṇḍamekakaraṃ bhavet | 
mekhalātritayaṃ veda rāmayugmāṅgulaiḥ kramāt || 48 || 

ekadvitrikaraṃ kuryādvedikopari maṇḍalam | 
brahmaviṣṇuravīnāṃ tu sarvatobhadramiṣyate || 49 || 

bhadraṃ tu sarvadevānāṃ navanāmistathā trayam | 
liṅgodbhavaṃ śivasyāpi latāliṅgodbhavaṃ tathā || 50 || 

bhadraṃ ca gaurītilakaṃ devīnāṃ pūjane hitam | 
ardhacandraṃ taḍāgeṣu cāpākāraṃ tathaiva ca || 51 || 

ṭaṅkābhaṃ svastika caiva vāpīkūpeṣu pūjayet | 
pīṭhikājalapādeṣu yonyākāraṃ tu kāmadam || 52 || 

gajadantaṃ mahādurge praśastaṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhavet | 
ṭaṅkābhaṃ caturasraṃ ca gajadantamihāyatam || 53 || 

vikhyātaṃ sarvatobhadraṃ jñeyānyanyāni lokataḥ | 
pūrvāditoraṇaṃ plakṣayajñāṅgavaṭapippalaiḥ || 54 || 

dvātriṃśatṣoḍaśāṣṭau ca hyuttamān vedapāragān | 
kulīnānaṅgasarvajñānyajñārthamabhimantrayet || 55 || 

maṇḍapastha tribhāgena uttare snānamaṇḍapam | 
sthaṇḍilaṃ bālukaṃ kṛtvā śamyayā snāpayetsuram || 56 || 

pṛ0 38) pañcagavyaiḥ kaṣāyaiśca valkalaiḥ kṣīravṛkṣajaiḥ | 
snāpayetpañcakalaśaiḥ śatavāraṃ jalena ca || 57 || 

vedamantrādivāditragītamaṅgalaniḥsvanaiḥ | 
vastreṇācchādayeddevaṃ vedyāṃtaṃ maṇḍapaṃ nayet || 58 || 

talpamāropayedvedyāmuttarāśahṇe nyasettataḥ | 
kalaśaṃ tu śirodeśe pādasthāne kamaṇḍalum || 59 || 

vajraṃ vaidūryakaṃ muktāmindranīlaṃ sunīlakam | 
puṣparāgaṃ ca gomedaṃ caṃdraṃ pūrvādito nyaset || 60 || 

vyajanaṃ dakṣiṇe deśe darpaṇaṃ vāmataḥ śubham | 
ratnanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāddikpālādikapūjanam || 61 || 

āgneyyāṃ gaṇapaṃ vidyādīśāne grahamaṇḍalam | 
nairṛtye vāstupūjā ca vāyavye mātaraḥ smṛtāḥ || 62 || 

vajraṃ vaiḍūryakaṃ muktāmindranīlaṃ sunīlakam | 
puṣparāgaṃ ca gomedaṃ candraṃ pūrvādiṣu yajet || 63 || 

suvarṇaṃ rajataṃ tāmraṃ kāṃsyaṃ rītiṃ ca sīsakam | 
vaṅgaṃ lohaṃ ca pūrvādidikṣu dhātūniha nyaset || 64 || 

vajraṃ vahniḥ sahadevī viṣṇukrāntendravāruṇī | 
śaṅkhinījyotiṣmatī caiva svariktāni kramānnyaset || 65 ||

yavavrīhistathā kaṅgurjūrṇākhyā ca tilairyutā | 
śālimudrāḥ samākhyātā godhūmāśca krameṇa tu || 66 || 

yaddevābharaṇaṃ pūjāvastrālaṅkārabhūṣaṇam | 
tatsarvaṃ śilpine deyamācāryāya tu yājñikam || 67 || 

tato mahotsavaṃ kuryānnṛtyagītairanekaśaḥ | 
naivedyārārtikaṃ pūjāmaṅganyāsādikaṃ tathā || 68 || 

pṛ0 39) kṣīraṃ kṣaudraṃ ghṛtaṃ khaṇḍapakvānnāni bahūnyapi | 
ṣaḍrasāḥ svādubhakṣāṇi samantāt parikalpayet || 69 || 

viprāṇāṃ sampradāyācca vedamantraistathāgamaiḥ | 
sakalīkaraṇaṃ jīvanyāsaṃ kṛtvā pratiṣṭhayet || 70 || 

prāsāde devatānyāsaṃ sthāvareṣu pṛthakpṛthak | 
kharaśilāyāṃ ca vārāhaṃ paulyāṃ nāgakulāni ca || 71 || 

prakumbhe jaladevāśca puṣkake kiṃsurāstathā | 
nandinī jāḍyakumbhe ca kalyāṇyāṃ sthāpayeddharim || 72 || 

gaṇeśaṃ gajapīṭhe ca aśvapīṭhe tathāśvinau | 
narapīṭhe narāṃścaiva kṣamāṃ ca khurake yajet || 73 || 

bhadre siddhitrayaṃ kumbhe pārvatīṃ kalaśe sthitām | 
kapotālyāṃ ca gandharvānmañcikāyāṃ sarasvatīm || 74 || 

jaṅghāyāṃ ca diśāpālānindramudgamasaṃsthitam | 
sāvitrīṃ bharaṇe deśe śirāvadyāṃ ca devikām || 75 || 

vidyādharān kapotālyāmantarāle surāṃstathā | 
paryaṅkakuṃṭhacchādye ca tato madhye pratiṣṭhayet || 76 || 

śākhayoścandrasūryau ca trimūrtiścottarāṅgake | 
udumbare sthitaṃ yakṣamaśvināvardhacandrake || 77 || 

kaulikāyāṃ dharādhāraṃ kṣitiṃ cotraṃ nṛpaṭṭake | 
stambheṣu parvatāṃścaivamākāśaṃ ca karoṭake || 78 || 

madhye pratiṣṭhayeddevaṃ sakare jāhnavīṃ tathā | 
śikharasyoruśṛṅgeṣu pañca pañca pratiṣṭhayet || 79 || 

brahmā viṣṇustathā rudra īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ | 
śikhare ceśvaraṃ devaṃ śikhāyāṃ tu surādhipam || 80 || 

pṛ0 40) grīvāyāmamare devaṃ maṇḍape ca niśākaram | 
padmākṣaṃ padmapatraṃ ca kalaśe ca sadāśivam || 81 || 

sadyo vāma aghorastatpuruṣa īśa eva ca | 
karṇādibhadraparyantaṃ pañcāṅge tān pratiṣṭhayet || 82 || 

iti sthāvarapratiṣṭhā || 

prathamaṃ devatādṛṣṭerdarśayeṃdannaparvatakam | 
vipraṃ kumārikāṃ vāstuṃ tato lokānpradarśayet || 83 || 

ījyānantarataḥ kuryātsūtradhārasya pūjanam | 
vastrālaṅkārabhūvittagomahiṣyāśvavāhanaiḥ || 84 || 

anyeṣāṃ śilpināṃ pūjā kartavyā karmakāriṇām | 
svādhikārānusāreṇa vastratāmbūlabhojanaiḥ || 85 || 

kāṣṭhapāṣāṇanirmāṇakāriṇo yatra mandire | 
bhuñjate tatra bhoktāsau śaṅkarastridaśaiḥ saha || 86 || 

puṇyaṃ prāsādajaṃ svāmī prārthayetsūtradhārataḥ | 
sūtradhāro vadet svāminna kṣayaṃ bhavatāt tava || 87 || 

iti sūtradhārapūjā | 

ācāryapūjanaṃ kṛtvā vastrasvarṇadhanaiḥ saha | 
dānaṃ dadyāddvijātibhyo dīnāndhadurbaleṣu ca || 88 || 

sarveṣāṃ dhanamādhāraḥ prāṇināṃ jīvanaṃ param | 
vitte datte pratuṣyanti mānuṣyāḥ pitaraḥ surāḥ || 89 || 


iti pratiṣṭhāvidhiḥ | 

pratiṣṭhā vittarāgasya jinaśāsanamārgataḥ |
navakāraiḥ sūramantraiśca siddhiḥ kevalabhāṣitam || 90 || 

grahāḥ sarvajñadevāśca pādapīṭhe pratiṣṭhitāḥ | 

pṛ0 41) yenānantavibhedena muktimārga udāhṛtaḥ || 91 || 

jinānāṃ mātaro yatra yakṣiṇī gautamī tathā | 
siddha kālatrayo jātāścaturviṃśatimūrtayaḥ || 92 || 

iti sthāpyaṃ jinācāre triprākāraṃ gṛhaṃ tathā | 
sāvantaśikharaṃ? mandiramaṣṭāpadādikam || 93 || 

prāsādo vītarāgasya puramadhye sukhāvahaḥ | 
kalyāṇakārivargasya caturdikṣu prakalpayet || 94 || 

iti jinapratiṣṭhā | 

māghādipañcamāseṣu vāpīkūpādi saṃsmṛtam | 
taḍāgasya caturmāsaṃ kuryādāṣāḍhamārgayoḥ || 95 || 

asaṃskṛtaṃ jalaṃ devāḥ pitaro na pibanti te | 
saṃskṛte tṛptimāyānti tasmātsaṃskāramācaret || 96 || 

jīvanaṃ vṛkṣajantūnāṃ yaḥ karoti jalāśayam | 
datte vā sa labhetsaukhyamurvyāṃ svarge ca mānavaḥ || 97 || 

purāndhakavadhe rudralalāṭātpatitaḥ kṣitau | 
svedastasmātsamudbhūtaṃ bhūtamatyantaduḥsaham || 98 || 

gṛhītvā sahasā devairnyastaṃ bhūmāvadhomukham | 
jānunī koṇayo pādau rakṣo diśi śive śiraḥ || 99 || 

catvāriṃśadyutā pañca vāstudehe sthitāḥ murāḥ | 
devyo'ṣṭau bāhyagāsteṣāṃ vasanādvāsturucyate || 100 ||  

adhomukhena vijñaptaistridaśairvihito baliḥ | 
tenaiva balinā śānti kurute hānimanyathā || 101 || 

prāsādabhavanādīnāṃ prārambhe parivartane | 
vāstukarmasu sarveṣu pūjitāḥ saukhyado bhavet || 102 || 

pṛ0 42) ekapadādito vāstu yāvatpadasahasrakam | 
dvātriṃśanmaṇḍalāni syuḥ kṣetratulyākṛtīni ca || 103 || 

ekāśītipado vastuścatuṣaṣṭipado'thavā | 
sarvavāstuvibhāgeṣu pūjayenmaṇḍaladvayam || 104 || 

īśo mūrddhani parjanyo dakṣiṇaṃ karṇamāśritaḥ | 
jayaḥskandhe mahendrādyāḥ pañca dakṣiṇabāhugāḥ || 105 || 

mahendraḥ sūryaḥ satyaśca bhṛśa ākāśameva ca | 
vāyurjānuni pūṣādyāḥ saptapādatale sthitāḥ || 106 || 

pūṣā ca vitathaścaiva gṛhakṣatayamāvubhau | 
gandharvo bhṛṅgarājaśca mṛgaḥ sapta surā iti || 107 || 

pādayoḥ pitarastasmātsaptapādatalasthitāḥ | 
dauvāriko'tha sugrīvaḥ puṣpadanto jalādhipaḥ || 108 || 

asuraḥ śoṣa pāpau ca rogo jānuni saṃsthitaḥ | 
ahirmukhyaśca bhallāṭaḥ somasarpauca bāhugau || 109 || 

aditistvadhodeśe ca vāme karṇe ditiḥ sthitaḥ | 
dvātriṃśadbāhyagā devā nābhipṛṣṭhe sthito vidhiḥ || 110 || 

aryamā dakṣiṇe vāme stane tu pṛthivīdharaḥ | 
vivasvāna'tha mitraśca dakṣavāmorugāvubhau || 111 || 

rudraśca rājayakṣmā ca āpavatso hṛdi sthitaḥ | 
sāvitraḥ savitā tadvatkaraṃ dakṣiṇamāśritau || 112 || 

indra indrajayo meḍhre bhadrau'sau vāmahastake | 
bhadradāso'pi tatraiva iti devamayaṃ vapuḥ || 113 || 

īśāne carakī bāhye piliṃpicchastu pūrvataḥ | 
vidārikāgnikoṇe ca vijṛmbhāpāṃdigāsthitā || 114 || 

pṛ0 43) nairṛtyeṃ pūtanā skandhe paścime vāyukoṇake | 
pāparākṣasikā saumye'ryamā vai sarvato'rcayet || 115 || 

herukādibalirdeyo māṣānnaiḥ surayāmiṣaḥ | 
aparān vaṭakānnaiśca sarvān svarṇasugandhibhiḥ || 116 || 

iti vāstuṣuruṣanyāsaḥ | 

ekena śāstreṇa guṇādhikena 
vinā dvitīye na padārthasiddhiḥ | 
tasmātprakārāntarato vilokya 
maṇīguṇāḍhyo'pi sahāyakāṃkṣī || 

śrīviśvakarmagaṇanāthameśacaṇḍī-
śrīviśvarūpajagadīśvarasuprasādāt | 
prāsādamaṇḍanamidaṃ ruciraṃ cakāra 
śrīmaṇḍano guṇavatāṃ bhuvi sūtradhāraḥ | 

iti śrīsūtradhāramaṇḍanaviracite vāstuśāstre prāsādamaṇḍane'ṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ || 8 || 

iti prāsādamaṇḍanaṃ samāptam | 



     

